cerative colitis confirmed by Mayo Score assessment, and evidence of colonic inflammation.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients aged 18-74, receiving therapy for active ulcerative colitis confirmed by Mayo Score assessment,",\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "y"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "aged"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18",\n        "74"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "18-74",\n        "receiving"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "therapy"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "ulcerative colitis"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "Mayo Score assessment"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "receiving",\n        "active"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "therapy"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "ulcerative colitis"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "Mayo Score assessment"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "and evidence of colonic inflammation.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "colonic inflammation"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "colonic inflammation"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
