tated.\n- Extract the text before and after the operator as "raw_text". An AND therefore always connects two "raw_text".\n[NOT]:\n- Insert [NOT] before a condition to exclude or negate it.\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none".\n- Write a [NOT] before phrases like "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence" when they negate a condition or requirement.\n- Example: Patients [NOT] unable to take medicines. [NOT] No history of cancer. [NOT] Not on hormone replacement therapy. [NOT] don\'t  have a history of smoking. [NOT] free from a history of alcoholism.\n- Extract the text after the operator as "raw_text". A NOT only refers to the following "raw_text".\n\n2. Create a JSON object based on the following rules:\n- The basic structure consists of nested "AND", "OR" and "NOT" operators.\n- Each AND and OR operator always has two branches: "left" and "right". Every left must always have a corresponding right.\n- The NOT operator has only one branch: "left".\n- "raw_text"  are leaf nodes with no children.\n- The extracted "raw_text" segments should be connected using the operators "AND", "OR", and "NOT" as per the rules above.\n\n3. Sequence and structure:\n- AND/OR always start with "left" and "right" branches\n- NOT always starts with a "left" branch\n- A "left" or "right" key is followed by either: another operator (AND, OR, NOT) or an object with "raw_text" (and optional additional fields)\n- "raw_text" fields contain the actual text of the criterion. The raw text must always be transferred in full.\n- Additional fields such as "Drug", "Condition", "Observation" or "Age" can appear next to "raw_text" to categorise specific terms.\n\n4. Extract the following entities from the raw text and include them in the JSON object:\nNodes could include attributes such as:\n- "raw_text": A string representing the raw text description of the medical condition, procedure, or other relevant details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Current injury is a pathologic fracture\n2. Sustained bilateral tibia fracture\n3. Sustained comminuted femur fracture\n4. Sustained severe Traumatic Brain Injury (GCS<12) ***\n5. Sustained severe spinal cord injury (lower extremity paresis/paralysis)\n6. Sustained severe burns (>10% total body surface area (TBSA) or >5% TBSA with full thickness or circumferential injury)\n7. Prior ipsilateral leg injury requiring surgery\n8. Prior or current lower limb deformity or abnormality\n9. Unable to complete follow-up visits\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "1. Current injury is a pathologic fracture",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "injury",\n                                    "pathologic fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "injury",\n                                    "pathologic fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "Current"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "Current"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. Sustained bilateral tibia fracture",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "tibia fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "tibia fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "bilateral"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "3. Sustained comminuted femur fracture",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "femur fracture"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "femur fracture"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "comminuted"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "4. Sustained severe Traumatic Brain Injury (GCS<12) ***",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "Traumatic Brain Injury"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "Traumatic Brain Injury"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "GCS"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "GCS"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "<12"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "<"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "12"\n                          ],\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "severe"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "5. Sustained severe spinal cord injury (lower extremity paresis/",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "spinal cord injury",\n                            "injury",\n                            "lower extremity paresis"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "spinal cord injury",\n                            "injury",\n                            "lower extremity paresis"\n                          ],\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "severe"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "paralysis)",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "paralysis"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "paralysis"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or full thickness or circumferential injury)",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "full thickness",\n                                "circumferential"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "6. Sustained severe burns (>10% total body surface area (TBSA) or >5% TBSA with full thickness or circumferential injury)",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "burns",\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "burns",\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    ">10% total body surface area (TBSA)",\n                    ">5% TBSA"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    ">"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "10",\n                    "5"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Unit": [\n                    "% total body surface area",\n                    "% TBSA"\n                  ],\n                  "Severity": [\n                    "severe"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "full thickness",\n                    "circumferential"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "7. Prior ipsilateral leg injury requiring surgery",\n              "Condition": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "surgery"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "surgery"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Prior"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "Prior"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "ipsilateral leg"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "requiring"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "8. Prior or current lower limb deformity",\n              "Condition": [\n                "lower limb deformity"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "lower limb deformity"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Prior or current"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "Prior or current"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or abnormality",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "abnormality"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "abnormality"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or lower extremity paresis/paralysis)",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "lower extremity paresis",\n                    "paralysis"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "lower extremity paresis",\n                    "paralysis"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "9."\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "Unable to complete follow-up visits",\n              "Encounter": [\n                "follow-up visits"\n              ],\n              "Negation": [\n                "Unable"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "Unable"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
