ion of both sexes was included in the study.\n2. Patients younger than 25 years old.\n3. Patients included in the study were post traumatic patients, hemifacial microsomia, Treacher Collins and post ankylotic mandibular deformity.\n4. Distraction range was between 15-20 mm.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. Patients free from any disease affecting bone formation of both sexes was included in the study.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "disease"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "disease"\n                  ],\n                  "Stability": [\n                    "affecting"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "bone formation"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "bone formation"\n                  ],\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "free from"\n                  ],\n                  "Study": [\n                    "study"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "2. Patients younger than 25 years old.",\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "years"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "25"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "younger than 25 years"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "younger than"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "old"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "3. Patients included in the study were post traumatic p